      "description": "The quarter's global browse layer: RGB, JPEG quality 85 with an internal transparency mask, dense tiles, EPSG:3857 at zoom 9 (305.75 m per pixel), 256-pixel internal blocks aligned to the Web Mercator tile grid, with a full overview pyramid. Composited from the published B04, B03 and B02 COGs, stretched 0..2500 reflectance units to 0..255 with exponent 0.55. The mask is 0 where the quarter has no valid observation; a reader that ignores masks shows those pixels black.",
